    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1>🟢 FULIZA M-PESA</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Kenya's #1 Overdraft Service. Borrow. Repay. Thrive.</p>
      <p class="hero-desc">
        Fuliza is Safaricom's overdraft facility that allows M-PESA users to
        complete transactions even when they have insufficient funds.
        Understand exactly how overdraft charges work — and how much agents earn.
      </p>
      <a href="#brackets" class="btn">View Fuliza Brackets</a>
